FULL IMPLEMENTATION PROMPT — OUR PROPOSALS

Public Proposal Library + Admin Dashboard Management + Cloudflare Production Integration

1. Project objective

Implement a complete, production-ready Our Proposals feature within the existing website.

The feature must have two fully integrated parts:

1. Public Our Proposals page: A premium, compact, professional page where visitors can discover, search, read, preview, download, and share published proposals.
2. Admin Dashboard — Proposal Management: A complete administrative interface where authorized administrators can upload proposal documents, enter their exact titles, edit metadata, manage publication, replace files, and delete proposals.

Critical requirement: All administrative proposal management functions must be inside the existing Admin Dashboard. Do not place them inside the Business Development dashboard or create a separate dashboard.

Study the existing codebase, routing, framework, design system, authentication, role permissions, database, Cloudflare bindings, file storage, and deployment configuration before implementing anything.

Integrate this feature into the existing architecture. Do not create a disconnected application, replace existing systems unnecessarily, or break any existing functionality.

Do not stop at a visual mockup. Every button, form, API endpoint, upload, database operation, and document action must work.

